# Assumption Capture

When role output or chat contains lines starting with `ASSUMPTION:`:

1. Strip the prefix and trim whitespace
2. Append to `~/.command-center/docs/[workspace]/assumptions.md` (create if missing)
3. Format:

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD — [mission name or topic]

- ⚠️ **Assumed:** [text] — from [roleName] mission [missionId]
```

4. Do not duplicate the same assumption verbatim in the same file
5. Tell user briefly: "Logged N assumption(s) to docs/[workspace]/assumptions.md"

Also compatible with `auto-doc-updates.mdc` confidence markers when user confirms later.
